      "content": "The advice regarding soft power and discreet networks is sound, but I fear the complexity of the modern digital landscape. The pretenders have eyes everywhere—media, intelligence, and financial watchers. If I begin to build these connections, even under a veil of anonymity, how can I ensure that my true lineage isn't unmasked by a mere slip in my digital conduct or an unexpected connection to my ancestral records? I need to know how to manipulate the very systems meant to track me.",
